        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coal stove, 5-15 kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coal stove, 5-15 kW
Lifetime is assumed to be 30 years. No specification of type.;
UUID: 0f99f895-6bb3-3b16-bf60-aab9ab21b8f2
Average stoves installed in the early 1990s. The module includes materials, energy and transport requirements, used for construction of the stove. Also construction of the chimney and the storage is included. Disposal of material is also included.
Location: German condition.
Technology: Average used in early 1990s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0f99f895-6bb3-3b16-bf60-aab9ab21b8f2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
